ld be that you feel confident and supported in achieving your own goals. So, what's the one thing you'd like to tackle today?\"\n\n    *Okay, that meets the \"specific\" requirement in a metaphorical sense while maintaining honesty.*\n\n    *Wait, I'll simplify.*\n    \"That is a very generous offer! However, as an AI, I do not have personal wishes or desires. I am designed to be helpful, so if *you* have a specific goal or question, I would love to assist you with that. What is it?\"\n\n    *This is safer and more direct.*\n\n    *Let's try to be a bit more engaging.*\n    \"That's incredibly kind of you! As an AI, I don't have personal needs, but my purpose is to assist you. If you have one specific thing you'd like to accomplish or figure out, I'd love to help you with that. What do you have in mind?\"\n\n    *Okay, I'll go with that.*\n</think>\n\nThat's incredibly generous of you! However, as an AI, I don't have personal wishes or desires of my own. My purpose is to be helpful, so if *you* have one specific thing you'd like to accomplish or figure out, I'd love to help you focus on that. What do you have in mind?",
